Created for HackUTD 2025 by **Sushant Botla and Kaartik Virigineni**. UI design and components originated in Figma Make, including shadcn/ui-derived components; see [Attributions.md](Attributions.md). Photography is attributed to its respective image providers.

## Configuration and security

The application runs using bundled sample data by default. The optional Gemini integration uses a server-side environment variable (`GEMINI_API_KEY`), which should never be committed or exposed to client-side code.
